PcWord 1.90

A fast, compact, flexible
Text-Processor; Uses HyperText functions
to facilitate links for Table of Contents
and Index, with automatic page numbering.

DOS 2.11 320K RAM, 560K disk, 8088 PC/XT

By TaliSoft, Andrew Sprott
Freeware.

RSORT is a sorting utility based on the 
sorting functions in PcWord; 

RSort is self explained and is ready to run.
Source code included.
